---
// 판정 표시: 모양 + 글자 + 색(설계 3-3, 4-1). 넷 밖의 값은 "판정 없음".
import { isVerdict, VERDICT_CLASS } from "../lib/verdicts";
interface Props { verdict: string; size?: "sm" | "md"; struck?: boolean }
const { verdict, size = "sm", struck = false } = Astro.props;
const ok = isVerdict(verdict);
const cls = ["verdict", size, ok ? VERDICT_CLASS[verdict] : "v-none", struck ? "struck" : ""].join(" ");
---
<span class={cls}>{ok && (
  <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    {verdict === "확인" && <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.5" fill="currentColor" />}
    {verdict === "일부 맞음" && <><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" /><path d="M8 2a6 6 0 0 0 0 12z" fill="currentColor" /></>}
    {verdict === "사실과 다름" && <><rect x="1.75" y="1.75" width="12.5" height="12.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" /><path d="M5 5l6 6M11 5l-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" /></>}
    {verdict === "확인 못 함" && <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="2.2 1.8" />}
  </svg>
)}<span class="sr-only">{struck ? "지난 판정: " : "판정: "}</span><span class="label">{ok ? verdict : "판정 없음"}</span></span>
